{"4350410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slot Car Simulator", "steam_appid": 4350410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a slot car racing simulator where you control miniature cars running on real-world inspired circuits.Enjoy high-speed driving, tight corners, and precise mouse-click controls.From casual single-player races to competitive events with up to 16 NPC cars, a wide range of play styles is supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/1ca25c7ac047055b475cf3e67c0dab26.poster.avif?t=1782338666\" width=776 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/1ca25c7ac047055b475cf3e67c0dab26.webm?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/1ca25c7ac047055b475cf3e67c0dab26.mp4?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Slot Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot cars are miniature electric cars that run along dedicated slots (grooves) built into the track. Players control the speed of the car by adjusting the power supplied to the lane using a controller. Because the car automatically follows the slot, steering is unnecessary.What matters most is how much power you apply, and exactly when you release it. In corners especially, pushing too hard will cause the car to fly off the track ? a course out.Riding that fine line between speed and control is the greatest thrill of slot car racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Steering Required in This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is operated entirely with mouse clicks.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Change Lanes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Right Click: Accelerate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release Right Click: Decelerate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Middle Mouse Button: Switch Camera View</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key decisions are how far to accelerate and when to cut power.Push too hard in a corner and you’ll go off the track. Mastering that split-second judgment is what separates victory from defeat. With the distinctive lever-like feel of slot car control, timing-based lane changes, and a game-friendly automatic recovery system, anyone can quickly dive into the excitement of racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built-in Circuit Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a circuit editor that lets you freely create your own tracks. Beyond racing, you can design, test, and drive original circuits of your own making.You can also place items to create diorama-style scenes, stimulating your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Circuit Editor Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three different stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive mouse-based course placement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic generation of overpasses at lane intersections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout adjustment by moving control points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curb placement for corners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item selection and placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit save function</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit reset function</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/0776ac4e423a30929a4eff9f8edcbc2b.poster.avif?t=1782338666\" width=770 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/0776ac4e423a30929a4eff9f8edcbc2b.webm?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/0776ac4e423a30929a4eff9f8edcbc2b.mp4?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/2399f8b4dbcab40c62d7481311a1900a.poster.avif?t=1782338666\" width=776 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/2399f8b4dbcab40c62d7481311a1900a.webm?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/2399f8b4dbcab40c62d7481311a1900a.mp4?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Updates Planned!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, the content is carefully curated?but this is only the starting line. Future updates will expand the experience with additional cars and editor items, as well as a wide variety of race scenes spanning different eras and themes. From formula cars and oval track racing to rally stages and mountain passes, the slot car experience will continue to grow and evolve with every update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relive That Excitement Once</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MoreSlot cars were once a distant dream hobby from childhood — something exciting, but not easy to obtain. Tiny supercars racing at incredible speeds along narrow lanes. The tension and exhilaration of pushing through corners, where a single moment’s decision determines success or failure.Imagine experiencing that thrill anytime, anywhere, with no setup required. Now, take that once-distant dream hobby and let it run freely on your PC screen. A full-scale 3D slot car racing experience with up to 16 cars on track simultaneously(planned to expand to up to 24 cars in future updates).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With each update, the racing experience will continue to grow.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>English</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a slot car racing simulator where you control miniature cars running on real-world inspired circuits.Enjoy high-speed driving, tight corners, and precise mouse-click controls.From casual single-player races to competitive events with up to 16 NPC cars, a wide range of play styles is supported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/1ca25c7ac047055b475cf3e67c0dab26.poster.avif?t=1782338666\" width=776 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/1ca25c7ac047055b475cf3e67c0dab26.webm?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/1ca25c7ac047055b475cf3e67c0dab26.mp4?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Slot Cars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slot cars are miniature electric cars that run along dedicated slots (grooves) built into the track. Players control the speed of the car by adjusting the power supplied to the lane using a controller. Because the car automatically follows the slot, steering is unnecessary.What matters most is how much power you apply, and exactly when you release it. In corners especially, pushing too hard will cause the car to fly off the track ? a course out.Riding that fine line between speed and control is the greatest thrill of slot car racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Steering Required in This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is operated entirely with mouse clicks.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Change Lanes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Right Click: Accelerate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release Right Click: Decelerate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Middle Mouse Button: Switch Camera View</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key decisions are how far to accelerate and when to cut power.Push too hard in a corner and you’ll go off the track. Mastering that split-second judgment is what separates victory from defeat. With the distinctive lever-like feel of slot car control, timing-based lane changes, and a game-friendly automatic recovery system, anyone can quickly dive into the excitement of racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built-in Circuit Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a circuit editor that lets you freely create your own tracks. Beyond racing, you can design, test, and drive original circuits of your own making.You can also place items to create diorama-style scenes, stimulating your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Circuit Editor Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three different stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive mouse-based course placement</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic generation of overpasses at lane intersections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layout adjustment by moving control points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curb placement for corners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item selection and placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit save function</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit reset function</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/0776ac4e423a30929a4eff9f8edcbc2b.poster.avif?t=1782338666\" width=770 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/0776ac4e423a30929a4eff9f8edcbc2b.webm?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/0776ac4e423a30929a4eff9f8edcbc2b.mp4?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/2399f8b4dbcab40c62d7481311a1900a.poster.avif?t=1782338666\" width=776 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/2399f8b4dbcab40c62d7481311a1900a.webm?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/extras/2399f8b4dbcab40c62d7481311a1900a.mp4?t=1782338666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ongoing Updates Planned!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At launch, the content is carefully curated?but this is only the starting line. Future updates will expand the experience with additional cars and editor items, as well as a wide variety of race scenes spanning different eras and themes. From formula cars and oval track racing to rally stages and mountain passes, the slot car experience will continue to grow and evolve with every update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relive That Excitement Once</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MoreSlot cars were once a distant dream hobby from childhood — something exciting, but not easy to obtain. Tiny supercars racing at incredible speeds along narrow lanes. The tension and exhilaration of pushing through corners, where a single moment’s decision determines success or failure.Imagine experiencing that thrill anytime, anywhere, with no setup required. Now, take that once-distant dream hobby and let it run freely on your PC screen. A full-scale 3D slot car racing experience with up to 16 cars on track simultaneously(planned to expand to up to 24 cars in future updates).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With each update, the racing experience will continue to grow.</i></p>", "short_description": "This game recreates the excitement of slot cars as a 3D video game, delivering a lane-based racing experience. Up to 16 cars race simultaneously using a physics engine, making slot car fun instantly accessible. The controls are simple—no steering required.Just click the mouse to race!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/f202eede9cad44f39e0018042552ae43abcefd44/header.jpg?t=1782338666", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/a981d7dbaafd5978588d42e5aa995cd55425a688/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782338666", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4350410/a981d7dbaafd5978588d42e5aa995cd55425a688/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782338666", "website": "https://w